			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration with tab indentation\n\nUnify indentation across all three ESBuild configuration files using hard tabs to match the project-wide convention. The previous commit converted these files to spaces; this commit aligns them with the tab-based style used throughout the rest of the Worker element.\n\n- `Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js`: wrap long `__name` and `deepmerge` call chains, add trailing commas, condense export statement\n- `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`: convert space indentation to tabs, reformat plugin `outdir` conditional chain\n- `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`: convert 4-space indentation to tabs, move `catch` to same line as closing brace\n\nZero functional changes — build output is identical.",
			"SHA": "5d1c9baf4fc8153bedb975d98c99e45350ed307f"
		},
